4.5.8. Create Separate Public Cluster Network NAD for storage:
logic is to create a NAD for MULTUS network on top of the interface (might be single IF, bond or VLAN) which was created for MACVLAN in the above NNCP policies.



ocs-public-cluster-with-pub-shim.yaml


# single interface

apiVersion: "k8s.cni.cncf.io/v1"
kind: NetworkAttachmentDefinition
metadata:
  name: ocs-public-cluster
  namespace: openshift-storage
spec:
  config: '{
    "cniVersion": "0.3.1",
    "type": "macvlan",
    "master": "ens4f1",
    "mode": "bridge",
    "ipam": {
      "type": "whereabouts",
      "range": "10.200.63.0/24",
      "exclude": [
         "10.200.63.2/32",   # add all the static IPs of nodes, previously added in NNCP configurations
         "10.200.63.3/32",
         "10.200.63.4/32"
      ],
      "routes": [
         {"dst": "10.200.63.0/24"}
      ]
    }
  }'

//////////////////////////////////////////////////////

